# Grand Central credentials: TEMPLATE (safe to commit; no real secrets here).
#
# Copy to `.env` in this directory, fill in real values, then:
#     chmod 600 config/.env
# Never commit `.env`. Plain KEY=value lines; launchd jobs don't see your
# shell environment, so keys must live here.

# --- Gmail (required): one USER + APP_PASSWORD pair per account ------------
# The middle of the key is the account's short name (slug): WORK -> "work".
# App password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords (2-Step Verification
# must be on). Paste the 16 characters WITHOUT spaces.
GMAIL_WORK_USER=you@yourcompany.com
GMAIL_WORK_APP_PASSWORD=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
GMAIL_PERSONAL_USER=you@gmail.com
GMAIL_PERSONAL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# The From display name, for every account or per account
SENDER_NAME=Your Name
# GMAIL_WORK_NAME=Your Name (Your Company)

# --- Claude (strongly recommended) ------------------------------------------
# Summaries, drafts, Ask, the day note and the Wizard. Without it the board
# still runs and those features switch off.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# --- Google Calendar ------------------------------------------------------
# Read: each calendar's "Secret address in iCal format" (Settings ->
# <calendar> -> Integrate calendar). Comma-separated. Treat as secrets.
GCAL_ICS_URLS=https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/.../basic.ics
# Write (create events, RSVP): the `gog` CLI, granted per account with
#   gog auth add you@yourcompany.com --services calendar
# Headless (launchd) runs may need this to unlock gog's file keyring:
# GOG_KEYRING_PASSWORD=

# --- Granola meeting notes (optional) -------------------------------------
# GRANOLA_TOKEN=grn_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# --- Jev classification by TypeSafe (optional; switch on per account) -----
# JEV_API_KEY=

# --- Web push to your phone (optional; needs HTTPS) -----------------------
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com

# --- Open/click tracking on sent mail (optional) --------------------------
# A shared secret with the Cloudflare Worker in integrations/tracker/.
# TRACK_SECRET=
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=

# --- Process settings (set in the launchd plist or your shell, not here) --
# GC_PORT=8080            the board's port
# GC_ALLOW_LAN=1          also accept connections from the local network
# GC_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=     extra hostnames allowed to POST (e.g. your tunnel)
# GC_DB_PATH=             a different database file (tests, demos)
